# Summary

The handbook states the parking rule: Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook. [[cite:obs-8891d25028c8e5e645cec32e0591e1ed8191ac66 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]]

The appendix reserves bays twelve through thirty. [[cite:obs-92dd82a8c6d9c613fb8e5328e9b61b3c9ce1a9ed "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]]

Those bays are blocked for supplier vans only. [[cite:obs-92dd82a8c6d9c613fb8e5328e9b61b3c9ce1a9ed "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]]

The appendix sets a time limit described as a midday deadline. [[cite:obs-92dd82a8c6d9c613fb8e5328e9b61b3c9ce1a9ed "midday deadline."]]
